      "status_terms_zh": [],
      "summary_en": "Zeri's Attacks deal magic damage and are treated as Abilities. Moving and casting Burst Fire stores up energy in Zeri's Sparkpack. When fully charged her next Attack deals bonus damage.",
      "summary_zh": "泽丽的攻击造成魔法伤害并被视为技能。移动和施放【电火迸射】会将能量储存至泽丽的【火花背包】。在完全充能后，她的下次攻击将造成额外伤害。",
