      "summary_en": "Burst Fire shoots a burst of 7 rounds that deal attack damage to the first enemy hit. This Ability is treated as an Attack.",
      "summary_zh": "【电火迸射】连续发射7发子弹，对命中的首个敌人造成相当于攻击力的物理伤害。这个技能会被视为一次攻击。",
