      "summary_en": "Zeri fires an electric pulse that slows and damages the first enemy hit. If the pulse hits a wall it expands into a long range laser.",
      "summary_zh": "泽丽发射一道电能脉冲，来对首个命中的敌人造成减速和伤害。如果脉冲命中了一个墙体，那么它会延伸为一道长程激光。",
