      "summary_en": "Zeri dashes a short distance and energizes Burst Fire to pierce through enemies. She will vault and grind over any terrain she touches.",
      "summary_zh": "泽丽冲刺一小段距离，并激发【电火迸射】，使其获得穿刺敌人的效果。她将在接触任何地形时进行翻越和滑行。",
