      "summary_en": "Zeri discharges a nova of electricity and overcharges herself, gaining increased damage and stacking Move Speed that refreshes and gets stronger every time she hits an enemy champion. While overcharged, Burst fire becomes a faster triple shot that chains lightning between enemies.",
      "summary_zh": "泽丽放出一道电能新星，并且自身进入超负荷状态，来获得伤害提升和可叠加的移动速度，并且这个状态可在她每次命中敌方英雄时刷新持续时间并变得更强。在超负荷状态下。【枪火迸射】会变成一个快速的3连发，并在敌人之间引发连锁闪电。",
